                                                "sense_id": "438afd55-75cd-31f5-97f6-927a91f6aa7b",
                                                "text": "2002. David Diamond. The Trucker & The Professor, Wired (magazine), Issue 9.12http://www.wired.com/wired/archive/9.12/sheffi.html?pg=2&topic=&topic_set=\nHe deposits his trailer at a Marten facility in nearby Stockton, and then drives without the trailer - that's called \"bobtailing\"."
