                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c535822a-c4f6-42ed-9da6-e2a7ddcdb28e",
                                                "sense_id": "104b7215-6d87-36dc-817b-e7a687decae3",
                                                "text": "2003. Bergmann Co. Bergmann's Cleaning History:https://web.archive.org/web/20071012131035/http://bergmanns.com/company_history.asp\nW.C. Bergmann was supplementing his meager lamplighter's income by \"bobtailing\"… picking up laundry and cleaning in his horse drawn truck..."
